{"kind":"notes","id":"nt/n0g933","slideIndex":3,"text":"\nSource: FoodBridge project brief supplied by the team. Technical structures and examples describe a proposed design, not verified implementation.\nSuggested states: AVAILABLE, CLAIMED, ASSIGNED, PICKED_UP, DELIVERED. EXPIRED and CANCELLED are alternate outcomes. A claim checks eligibility and availability. Food handling guidance and deadlines help coordination but do not establish food safety by themselves."}
