{"kind":"notes","id":"nt/ma6wp5","slideIndex":6,"text":"\nSource: FoodBridge project brief supplied by the team. Technical structures and examples describe a proposed design, not verified implementation.\nThis is a single-primary-role teaching model, not a final implementation decision. If one account must hold several roles, User plus UserRoles and composed role capabilities is more flexible than a rigid subclass hierarchy. Java inheritance does not require every subclass to have its own database table."}
