{"kind":"notes","id":"nt/wzep40","slideIndex":9,"text":"\nSource: FoodBridge project brief supplied by the team. Technical structures and examples describe a proposed design, not verified implementation.\nPickups uses pickup_id as PK and claim_id as a UNIQUE FK. volunteer_id references Users. DeliveryRecords uses delivery_id as PK and pickup_id as a UNIQUE FK. Notifications includes notification_id, recipient_user_id, message and read_at. Use UNIQUE(donation_id) in DonationClaims for this one-claim-per-donation model. If cancellation and re-claiming need full history, redesign active claims and claim events explicitly."}
