{"kind":"notes","id":"nt/tt9h2y","slideIndex":10,"text":"\nSource: FoodBridge project brief supplied by the team. Technical structures and examples describe a proposed design, not verified implementation.\n3NF means non-key attributes depend on the key without depending on another non-key attribute. The composite-key linking table helps demonstrate 2NF. Business services also validate role authorization, deadlines and permitted status changes. Indexing does not replace normalization."}
